---

<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What it is</p>
      <h2 id="about-heading">What is DF Legends?</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      DF Legends turns the historical data generated by Dwarf Fortress into an
      interface designed for exploration.
    </p>

    <p>
      Dwarf Fortress already keeps a detailed chronicle of the world it
      generates — the figures who lived, the civs that rose and fell, the sites
      they founded and the events that ended them. DF Legends is built to read
      that record, so a finished world can be studied long after the fortress is
      gone.
    </p>

    <p>
      The project works only with what the game actually recorded. Where the
      history is silent, DF Legends shows the gap instead of filling it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>